session RoboCert = HOL +
  description "Planar-2R quantified semialgebraic claims: independent cross-check of the
    bounded existential / interval-membership shape, complementing formal/rocq's polynomial
    identities and formal/RoboCert's (Lean) checker-model soundness theorem. See
    formal/README.md for what is and is not proved."
  options [document = false]
  (* The theory lives in the RoboCert/ subdirectory, mirroring formal/rocq/RoboCert/ and
     formal/RoboCert/. Isabelle resolves theory names relative to this ROOT file, so the
     subdirectory must be declared explicitly -- omitting it produces
     "No such file: .../formal/isabelle/Planar2R.thy". *)
  directories
    RoboCert
  theories
    "RoboCert/Planar2R"
